            "body": "Thanks for the issue. I can not reproduce (even with 'comment' tree-sitter parser installed) , as 'comment' filetype doesn't have 'commentstring' option set by default.\r\n\r\nIt seems like something in your config sets it. It might set at least through following mechanisms:\r\n- Autocommands. What is the output of `:au FileType comment`?\r\n- Filetype plugins. What is the output of `:=vim.api.nvim_get_runtime_file('ftplugin/comment*', true)`?",
