            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Here's your issue: https://github.com/oncomouse/dotfiles/blob/72c545d59ea4097584158e6a6e0bbed07a6cbc6f/conf/vim/init.lua#L59\r\n\r\ncomment.nvim requires an empty default commentstring to know when to look for containing tree-sitter regions. (This is how Neovim behaves by default, and you should not change it.)",
